		{"id":"5357b3b37860d82c","x":-373,"y":-440,"width":673,"height":1120,"type":"text","text":"```json\n# ontology_concpetual\n{\n  \"id\": \"string\",                     // unique concept ID (UUID or deterministic)\n  \"name\": \"string\",                   // canonical business name\n  \"kind\": \"entity | metric | dimension | dq_rule | process\",\n\n  \"description\": \"string\",            // human-readable meaning\n  \"domain\": \"string\",                 // e.g., gl_accounting, fpna, budgeting\n  \"is_primary\": true,\n\n  \"logic_spec\": {\n    \"expressions\": [\n      {\n        \"expression_id\": \"string\",     // system-generated, stable\n        \"expression_name\": \"string\",   // human-friendly\n        \"logic_type\": \n          \"identity | computation | derivation | validation | aggregation\",\n\n        \"expression_summary\": \"string\", // WHAT this expression does (not SQL)\n        \"applies_to_kind\":\n          \"entity | metric | dimension | dq_rule | process\",\n\n        \"expected_inputs\": [\n          {\n            \"input_role\": \"string\",    // e.g., actual_amount, budget_amount\n            \"input_kind\": \n              \"entity | metric | dimension | attribute\",\n            \"description\": \"string\"\n          }\n        ],\n\n        \"output_type\": \"numeric | string | boolean | date | enum\",\n        \"status\": \"active | deprecated\",\n        \"version\": \"v1\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n\n  \"embedding_input\": \"rich semantic description for retrieval\",\n  \"embedding_vector\": [],\n\n  \"created_at\": { \"$date\": \"timestamp\" },\n  \"updated_at\": { \"$date\": \"timestamp\" }\n}\n \n```"},
